 text-center h-full px-5 md:px-14 undefined"><h1 class="break-words group-hover:text-stellarBlue font-fontHeading text-52 leading-52 md:text-80 xl:text-112 md:leading-80 xl:leading-122 md:-tracking-2% inline-block hero-banner-caps text-white">Meetings &amp; Events</h1></div></div></div><div class="w-full border-b border-lightStone"><div class="hidden md:flex items center justify-between py-4 md:py-7 md:px-16 md:max-w-[1400px] xl:max-w-[1600px] mx-auto"><div class="md:w-20"></div><nav class="relative md:max-w-[960px] lg:max-w-[1100px] xl:max-w-[1470px] md:mx-16"><ul class="flex items-center h-full space-x-16 whitespace-nowrap"><li class="inline-flex rtl:first:ml-16"><a target="_self" class=" nx-link" href="https://www.kempinski.com/en/hotel-corvinus-budapest/meetings-events"><h6 class="break-words group-hover:text-stellarBlue font-fontHeading text-28 leading-31 tracking-2% md:text-40 md:leading-44.3 inline-block undefined text-darkStone" style="font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif">Venues</h6></a></li><li class="inline-flex rtl:first:ml-16"><a target="_self" class=" nx-link" href="https://www.kempinski.com/en/hotel-corvinus-budapest/meetings-events/inspiring-events-offers"><h6 class="break-words group-hover:text-stellarBlue font-fontHeading text-28 leading-31 tracking-2% md:text-40 md:leading-44.3 inline-block undefined text-stellarBlue" style="font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif">Inspiring Events &amp; Offers</h6></a></li><li class="inline-flex rtl:first:ml-16"><a target="_self" class=" nx-link" href="https://www.kempinski.com/en/hotel-corvinus-budapest/meetings-events/wedding"><h6 class="break-words group-hover:text-stellarBlue font-fontHeading text-28 leading-31 tracking-2% md:text-40 md:leading-44.3 inline-block undefined text-stellarBlue" style="font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif">Wedding</h6></a></li><li class="inline-flex rtl:first:ml-16"><a target="_self" class=" nx-link" href="https://www.kempinski.com/en/hotel-corvinus-budapest/meetings-events/catering"><h6 class="break-words group-hover:text-stellarBlue font-fontHeading text-28 leading-31 tracking-2% md:text-40 md:leading-44.3 inline-block undefined text-stellarBlue" style="font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif">Catering</h6></a></li></ul></nav><div class="md:w-16"></div></div><nav class="md:hidden w-full overflow-x-auto py-4 px-6"><ul class="mx-auto w-fit h-full space-x-6 whitespace-nowrap"><li class="inline-flex"><a target="_self" class=" inline-block nx-link" href="https://www.kempinski.com/en/hotel-corvinus-budapest/meetings-events"><h6 class="break-words group-hover:text-stellarBlue font-fontHeading text-28 leading-31 tracking-2% undefined inline-block undefined text-darkStone" style="font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif">Venues</h6></a></li><li class="inline-flex"><a target="_self" class=" inline-block nx-link" href="https://www.kempinski.com/en/hotel-corvinus-budapest/meetings-events/inspiring-events-offers"><h6 class="break-words group-hover:text-stellarBlue font-fontHeading text-28 leading-31 tracking-2% undefined inline-block undefined text-stellarBlue" style="font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif">Inspiring Events &amp; Offers</h6></a></li><li class="inline-flex"><a target="_self" class=" inline-block nx-link" href="https://www.kempinski.com/en/hotel-corvinus-budapest/meetings-events/wedding"><h6 class="break-words group-hover:text-stellarBlue font-fontHeading text-28 leading-31 tracking-2% undefined inline-block undefined text-stellarBlue" style="font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif">Wedding</h6></a></li><li class="inline-flex"><a target="_self" class=" inline-block nx-link" href="https://www.kempinski.com/en/hotel-corvinus-budapest/meetings-events/catering"><h6 class="break-words group-hover:text-stellarBlue font-fontHeading text-28 leading-31 tracking-2% undefined inline-block undefined text-stellarBlue" style="font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif">Catering</h6></a></li></ul></nav></div><div class="flex flex-col items-center max-w-[880px] px-6 md:px-5 mx-auto mt-12 md:mt-24"><div class="mb-14 text-center ez-richtext-container table-richtext theme-richtext"><h3>Meetings &amp; Events in Budapest</h3><h3>1,238 sq m of purpose-built event space in downtown&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;</h3><p>Kempinski Hotel Corvinus <a href="https://www.kempinski.com/en/hotel-corvinus-budapest/budapest-travel-tips">Budapest</a> offers organisers 1,238 sq m of <a href="https://www.kempinski.com/en/hotel-corvinus-budapest/meetings-events/venues" target="_blank" title="Event Spaces - Venues at Kempinski Hotel Corvinus Budapest ">purpose-built event space</a> on the first floor. The setting keeps each programme together in one clearly defined part of the hotel. The venues are flexible and separable, each room sized to fit the capacity and creative needs of the event. The Grand Room holds up to 450 guests, and works for meetings, conferences, weddings and exhibitions. Technical support, catering and a committed, creative banquet team stand behind every event.<br><br>Guests have a central city address, easy to move between the day's agenda and an evening in the capital.&nbsp;</p><p>The result: memories your delegates and guests will remember you for.<br><br><strong>Location:</strong> Erzsébet Square, downtown Budapest<br><strong>Event space:</strong> 1,238 sq m on the first floor<br><strong>Largest conference capacity:</strong> Up to 450 guests<br><strong>Planning resources:</strong> Floor plan, image gallery and virtual tour<br><strong>Event services:</strong> Technical support and <a href="https://www.kempinski.com/en/hotel-corvinus-budapest/meetings-events/catering" target="_blank" title="Catering" data-ezattribute-disable_popup="false" data-ezattribute-open_external_in_the_same_tab="false">catering</a><br><br><strong>How do I contact Kempinski Hotel Corvinus Budapest to plan an event?</strong><br>Contact Kempinski Hotel Corvinus Budapest through the 'Request for Proposal' form on this page. You can also email <a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#fc9199998895929b8fd29f938e8a9592898fbc9799918c95928f9795d29f9391" data-ezattribute-disable_popup="false" data-ezattribute-open_external_in_the_same_tab="false"><span class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="88e5ededfce1e6effba6ebe7fafee1e6fdfbc8e3ede5f8e1e6fbe3e1a6ebe7e5">[email&#160;protected]</span></a> with your event brief.</p><p><strong>Where can I access the floor plan, image gallery and virtual tour?</strong><br>You can access the floor plan, image gallery and virtual tour directly from the Meetings &amp; Events page for Kempinski Hotel Corvinus Budapest. Select each planning link to preview the spaces before making an enquiry.</p><p><strong>What types of events can Kempinski Hotel Corvinus Budapest host?</strong><br>Kempinski Hotel Corvinus Budapest can host meetings, conferences, exhibitions, weddings and social gatherings. From focused business discussions to joyful celebrations, <a href="https://www.kempinski.com/en/hotel-corvinus-budapest/meetings-events/inspiring-events-offers/private-event" target="_blank" title="Venue for every occasion at Kempinski Budapest">every occasion</a> can have its own character.<br>&nbsp;</p>
