ws":null,"page":{"metaTitle":"Meetings \u0026 Events in Budapest | Kempinski Hotel Corvinus","metaKeywords":"","metaDescription":"For any meeting, conference or event, Kempinski Hotel Corvinus Budapest has the venues \u0026 experienced staff to help you arrange your day. Contact us today for more information.","_location":{"id":151000,"path":[1,2,93563,151000],"pathString":"/1/2/93563/151000/","priority":6,"parentLocation":{"id":93563,"content":{"_name":"KIBUD - Hotel Corvinus Budapest"}},"urlAliases":[{"path":"/hotel-corvinus-budapest/meetings-events","languageCodes":["eng-GB"]},{"path":"/hotel-corvinus-budapest/meetings-events","languageCodes":["ger-DE"]},{"path":"/hotel-corvinus-budapest/meetings-events","languageCodes":["chi-CN"]},{"path":"/hotel-corvinus-budapest/meetings-events-rendezvenyek","languageCodes":["hun-HU"]}],"customUrlAliases":[]},"_contentInfo":{"id":155415,"currentVersion":{"languageCodes":["eng-GB","ger-DE","chi-CN","hun-HU"]}},"name":"Meetings \u0026 Events","title":"Meetings and Events in Budapest","email":"meetings.corvinus@kempinski.com","phone":"+36 1 429 3572","headerImage":{"image":{"uri":"/var/site/storage/images/0/5/7/6/1566750-1-eng-GB/b3b2bfc024a9-75387172_4K.jpg","alternativeText":"","additionalData":{"focalPointX":null,"focalPointY":null},"width":3840,"height":2560}},"description":{"html5":"\u003ch3\u003eMeetings \u0026amp; Events in Budapest\u003c/h3\u003e\u003ch3\u003e1,238 sq m of purpose-built event space in downtown\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eKempinski Hotel Corvinus \u003ca href=\"https://www.kempinski.com/en/hotel-corvinus-budapest/budapest-travel-tips\"\u003eBudapest\u003c/a\u003e offers organisers 1,238 sq m of \u003ca href=\"https://www.kempinski.com/en/hotel-corvinus-budapest/meetings-events/venues\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Event Spaces - Venues at Kempinski Hotel Corvinus Budapest \"\u003epurpose-built event space\u003c/a\u003e on the first floor. The setting keeps each programme together in one clearly defined part of the hotel. The venues are flexible and separable, each room sized to fit the capacity and creative needs of the event. The Grand Room holds up to 450 guests, and works for meetings, conferences, weddings and exhibitions. Technical support, catering and a committed, creative banquet team stand behind every event.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eGuests have a central city address, easy to move between the day's agenda and an evening in the capital.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe result: memories your delegates and guests will remember you for.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLocation:\u003c/strong\u003e Erzs\u0026eacute;bet Square, downtown Budapest\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEvent space:\u003c/strong\u003e 1,238 sq m on the first floor\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLargest conference capacity:\u003c/strong\u003e Up to 450 guests\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePlanning resources:\u003c/strong\u003e Floor plan, image gallery and virtual tour\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEvent services:\u003c/strong\u003e Technical support and \u003ca href=\"https://www.kempinski.com/en/hotel-corvinus-budapest/meetings-events/catering\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Catering\" data-ezattribute-disable_popup=\"false\" data-ezattribute-open_external_in_the_same_tab=\"false\"\u003ecatering\u003c/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHow do I contact Kempinski Hotel Corvinus Budapest to plan an event?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eContact Kempinski Hotel Corvinus Budapest through the 'Request for Proposal' form on this page. You can also email \u003ca href=\"mailto:meetings.corvinus@kempinski.com\" data-ezattribute-disable_popup=\"false\" data-ezattribute-open_external_in_the_same_tab=\"false\"\u003emeetings.corvinus@kempinski.com\u003c/a\u003e with your event brief.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhere can I access the floor plan, image gallery and virtual tour?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eYou can access the floor plan, image gallery and virtual tour directly from the Meetings \u0026amp; Events page for Kempinski Hotel Corvinus Budapest. Select each planning link to preview the spaces before making an enquiry.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhat types of events can Kempinski Hotel Corvinus Budapest host?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eKempinski Hotel Corvinus Budapest can host meetings, conferences, exhibitions, weddings and social gatherings. From focused business discussions to joyful celebrations, \u003ca href=\"https://www.kempinski.com/en/hotel-corvinus-budapest/meetings-events/inspiring-events-offers/private-event\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Venue for every occasion at Kempinski Budapest\"\u003eevery occasion\u003c/a\u003e can have its own character.\u003cbr\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n"},"shortDescription":{"html5":"\u003cp\u003eInspiring events by Kempinski in Budapest \u0026ndash; meet in the very heart of the city\u003c/p\u003e\n"},"rfpButtonText":"Request for Proposal","galleryImages":[{"name":"Central location","title":"Central location","description":"Meet and greet. Network. Deals sealed. Entertain. In the very heart of the city, at the Kempinski Corvinus, Budapest means business.","image":{"image":{"uri":"/var/site/storage/images/2/0/2/7/18037202-3-eng-GB/1674add6dcea-95762259_4K.jpg","alternativeText":"Meeting venue  'Room Eleven' exclusive boardroom at Kempinski Hotel Budapest","additionalData":{"focalPointX":null,"focalPointY":null},"width":5760,"height":3840}}},{"name":"Amaze your clients","title":"Amaze your clients","description":"Our varied meeting and conference venues bring together people for business and exchange of information. For weddings. Or social fun.","image":{"image":{"uri":"/var/site/storage/images/2/7/6/8/16498672-1-eng-GB/a7bf8c51331e-81181993_4K.jpg","alternativeText":"","additionalData":{"focalPointX":null,"focalPointY":null},"width":3000,"height":1992}}}],"venues":[{"metaTitle":"The Grand Room Meeting Room | Kempinski Hotel Corvinus Budapest","metaKeywords":"","metaDescription":"Suitable for up to 450 guests, The Grand Room at Kempinski Hotel Budapest is the perfect venue for a conference or press event. Book today.","_location":{"id":144985,"path":[1,2,93563,151000,144984,144985],"pathString":"/1/2/93563/151000/144984/144985/","priority":1,"parentLocation":{"id":144984,"content":{"_name":"Venues"}},"urlAliases":[{"path":"/hotel-corvinus-budapest/meetings-events/venues/grand-room","languageCodes":["eng-GB"]},{"path":"/hotel-corvinus-budapest/meetings-events/veranstaltungsorte/grand-room","languageCodes":["ger-DE"]},{"path":"/hotel-corvinus-budapest/meetings-events/venues/grand-room","languageCodes":["chi-CN"]},{"path":"/hotel-corvinus-budapest/meetings-events-rendezvenyek/helyszinek/grand-room","languageCodes":["hun-HU"]}],"customUrlAliases":[]},"_contentInfo":{"id":149249,"currentVersion":{"languageCodes":["eng-GB","ger-DE","chi-CN","hun-HU"]}},"id":"RG9tYWluQ29udGVudDo=","headerImage":{"image":{"uri":"/var/site/storage/images/0/4/8/6/1566840-1-eng-GB/fa4d25a03d60-75387188_4K.jpg","alternativeText":"","additionalData":{"focalPointX":null,"focalPointY":null},"width":3840,"height":2560}},"title":"The Grand Room","miceIndoorOutdoor":[{"name":"indoor"},{"name":"dedicated conference/event floor"},{"name":"city centre location"}],"maxRoomOccupancy":450,"venueSize":431,"description":{"html5":"\u003cp\u003eBuilt to impress, the Grand Room \u0026ndash; Rooms One, Two and Three \u0026ndash; features a spectacular new portal, consistent with the bespoke design elements of the Ground Floor Promenade.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eA state-of-the-art colour spectrum app that controls ambience and mood settings. Complete with 300+ spots and graced with tailored and purpose-designed Hungarian wall fixtures and as striking crystal chandeliers, this flexible space wows with its appearance as well as intelligence.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThe Grand Room of Kempinski Hotel Corvinus Budapest offers style and luxury arrangement solutions for up to 450 guests.\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFor planning at a glance: The Grand Room\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eDaylight: Yes\u003cbr\u003eSize: 431 sq m (4,637 sq ft)\u003cbr\u003eCeiling Height: 3.9 m (12.8 ft)\u003cbr\u003eDimension: 16.4 m (53,8 ft) (length) x 24.6 m (80,70 ft) (width)\u003cbr\u003eMaximum capacity: 450 guests (reception)\u003cbr\u003eSpecial feature: built-in audio (a superior-quality Bose system) and lighting (versatile palette of lights, RGB scale). There are 11 suspension points on which a projector/LCD monitor may be hung (up to 40 kg/point), which allows for flexible projection direction and distance.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eDiscreetly separable from the rest of the hotel and meeting rooms, Rooms One, Two or Three offers flexible arrangement solutions in Kempinski Hotel Corvinus Budapest\u0026rsquo;s signature decor and generous space, combined with state-of-the-art technology in 178 sq m of space, able to host up to 170 guests. Through the bay window, the elegant evening lights of Fashion Street borrow a special background for your event.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFor planning at a glance: Room One\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eDaylight: Yes\u003cbr\u003eSize: 178 sq m (1,915 sq ft)\u003cbr\u003eCeiling height: 3.9 m (12.8 ft)\u003cbr\u003eDimension: 16.4 m (53.8 ft) (length) x 8.2 m (26.90 ft) width\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003eMaximum capacity: 170 guests (reception)\u003cbr\u003eSpecial feature: built-in audio (a superior-quality Bose system) and lighting (versatile palette of lights)\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFor planning at a glance: Room Two and Room Three\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eDaylight: No\u003cbr\u003eSize: 128 sq m (1,377 sq ft)\u003cbr\u003eCeiling height: 3.9 m (12.8 ft)\u003cbr\u003eDimension: 16.4 m (53.8 ft) (length) x 8.2 m (26.90 ft) (width)\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003eMaximum capacity: 150 guests (reception)\u003cbr\u003eSpecial feature: built-in audio (a superior-quality Bose system) and lighting (versatile palette of lights)\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eFor more information and consultation, please contact us on\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href=\"tel://3614293478\"\u003e\u003cu\u003e+36 1 429 3478\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;or at\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href=\"mailto:meetings.corvinus@kempinski.com\"\u003e\u003cu\u003emeetings.corvinus@kempinski.com\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n"},"shortDescription":{"html5":"\u003cp\u003eFor timeless events in breathtaking grandeur. (Room One+Two+Three)\u003c/p\u003e\n"},"rfpButtonText":"Request for Proposal","venueLength":16.4,"venueWidth":24.6,"venueHeight":3.9,"reception":450,"banquet":320,"cabaret":200,"classroom":270,"cocktail":450,"ushape":null,"theatre":450,"boardroom":null,"miceTechnicalEquipment":[{"name":"superior-quality Bose system audio"},{"name":"versatile lighting palette (RGB scale)"}],"miceServices":[{"name":"cloakroom"},{"name":"storage facilities"},{"name":"av supplier (external)"},{"name":"wheelchair-accessible"},{"name":"air conditioning"},{"name":"coffee and/or tea making facilities"},{"name":"non-smoking"},{"name":"seperable meeting/event rooms"},{"name":"connecting meeting/event rooms"},{"name":"sustainable solutions"}],"miceAmbiance":[{"name":"natural daylight"},{"name":"chandelier"},{"name":"customised lighting for company/event colours"}],"galleryImages":[{"name":"Infinite Solutions","title":"Infinite Solutions","description":"Our signature luxury: perfection. The Kempinski Corvinus’ various flexible meeting spaces and services offer state-of-the-art technology, the latest equipment, that deliver tailored solutions for events of any size and purpose.","image":{"image":{"uri":"/var/site/storage/images/0/6/6/6/1566660-1-eng-GB/4fef30e93bd0-75387164_4K.jpg","alternativeText":"","additionalData":{"focalPointX":null,"focalPointY":null},"width":3840,"height":2560}}},{"name":"The Grand Room","title":"The Grand Room","description":"","image":{"image":{"uri":"/var/site/storage/images/0/1/3/0/18690310-3-eng-GB/c35e77d1cb5d-95762365_4K.jpg","alternativeText":"Grand Room Meeting Venue Budapest with Gala Setup at Kempinski Hotel Corvinus","additionalData":{"focalPointX":null,"focalPointY":null},"width":4509,"height":3000}}},{"name":"Room One","title":"Room One","description":"","image":{"image":{"uri":"/var/site/storage/images/0/9/6/6/1566690-1-eng-GB/4d565240839b-75387178_4K.jpg","alternativeText":"","additionalData":{"focalPointX":null,"focalPointY":null},"width":3840,"height":2560}}},{"name":"Room Two","title":"Room Two","description":"","image":{"image":{"uri":"/var/site/storage/images/0/1/1/7/1567110-1-eng-GB/52472b751a68-75387106_4K.jpg","alternativeText":"","additionalData":{"focalPointX":null,"focalPointY":null},"width":3839,"height":2559}}},{"name":"Room Three","title":"Room Three","description":"","image":{"image":{"uri":"/var/site/storage/images/0/8/0/7/1567080-1-eng-GB/5cbe846dbb23-75387194_4K.jpg","alternativeText":"","additionalData":{"focalPointX":null,"focalPointY":null},"width":3840,"height":2560}}},{"name":"Central location","title":"Central location","description":"Meet and greet. Network. Deals sealed. Entertain. In the very heart of the city, at the Kempinski Corvinus, Budapest means business.","image":{"image":{"uri":"/var/site/storage/images/2/0/2/7/18037202-3-eng-GB/1674add6dcea-95762259_4K.jpg","alternativeText":"Meeting venue  'Room Eleven' exclusive boardroom at Kempinski Hotel Budapest","additionalData":{"focalPointX":null,"focalPointY":null},"width":5760,"height":3840}}}],"_url":"/en/hotel-corvinus-budapest/meetings-events/venues/grand-room","button1Title":"Floor Plan","button1InternalLink":{"_url":null,"file":{"uri":"/en/content/download/156076/18520319?version=1"}},"button2Title":"","button2InternalLink":null,"button3Title":"Virtual Tour","button3ExternalLink":"https://speceffect.com/360/kempinski.html"},{"metaTitle":"ROOM FOUR Meeting Room | Kempinski Hotel Corvinus Budapest","metaKeywords":"","metaDescription":"Suitable for up to 6 guests, the Room Four at Kempinski Hotel Corvinus Budapest is the perfect venue for board meetings. Book today.","_location":{"id":144986,"path":[1,2,93563,151000,144984,144986],"pathString":"/1/2/93563/151000/144984/144986/","priority":2,"parentLocation":{"id":144984,"content":{"_name":"Venues"}},"urlAliases":[{"path":"/hotel-corvinus-budapest/meetings-events/venues/room-four","languageCodes":["eng-GB"]},{"path":"/hotel-corvinus-budapest/meetings-events/venues/room-four","languageCodes":["chi-CN"]},{"path":"/hotel-corvinus-budapest/meetings-events-rendezvenyek/helyszinek/room-four","languageCodes":["hun-HU"]},{"path":"/hotel-corvinus-budapest/meetings-events/veranstaltungsorte/room-four-meeting-room-kempinski-hotel-corvinus-budapest","languageCodes":["ger-DE"]}],"customUrlAliases":[]},"_contentInfo":{"id":149250,"currentVersion":{"languageCodes":["eng-GB","ger-DE","chi-CN","hun-HU"]}},"id":"RG9tYWluQ29udGVudDo=","headerImage":{"image":{"uri":"/var/site/storage/images/0/8/7/6/1566780-1-eng-GB/0f3399d00f4e-75387174_4K.jpg","alternativeText":"","additionalData":{"focalPointX":null,"focalPointY":null},"width":3000,"height":1979}},"title":"Room Four","miceIndoorOutdoor":[{"name":"indoor"},{"name":"city centre location"},{"name":"dedicated conference/event floor"}],"maxRoomOccupancy":6,"venueSize":29,"description":{"html5":"\u003cp\u003eRoom Four is dedicated to event organisers for flawless event support, management and supervision. Ideal for up to six persons and specifically designed as a hybrid boardroom, it fulfils the requirements of informal meetings as well as formal gatherings, with 29 sq m of surface space.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eRoom Four is outfitted with bespoke furniture and decorative pieces, and it features an eye-catching round window overlooking the hotel\u0026rsquo;s hall. The intimate location and smart interior design facilitate creative thinking during discussions, while there is a chalkboard for brainstorming sessions. It is equipped with a 55-inch Android LCD TV set, which offers connection with the screen from any cordless device. Room Four has its own built-in coffee station.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eNestled in a small hallway off the main events floor, it is also convenient for event organisers to set up their operating room here to take advantage of the location\u0026rsquo;s peace and quiet. For this reason, Room Four is also an ideal interview room; the sofa provides a comfortable setting for both the interviewer and the interviewee.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eComplete with storage facilities, Room Four can also serve auxiliary functions, such as a dressing room or for depositing accessories for your event and gifts for your delegates.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eRoom Four is in close proximity to Room Five. Technical support is available throughout your event, and catering, from drinks and pastries to lunch and dinner, is provided by Kempinski Corvinus Hotel Budapest\u0026rsquo;s kitchen team.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eFor inquiries, please contact us on\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href=\"tel://3614293478\"\u003e\u003cu\u003e+36 1 429 3478\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;or at\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href=\"mailto:meetings.corvinus@kempinski.com\"\u003e\u003cu\u003emeetings.corvinus@kempinski.com\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n"},"shortDescription":{"html5":"\u003cp\u003eDedicated to event organisers for a flawless event support and gathering.\u003c/p\u003e\n"},"rfpButtonText":"Request for Proposal","venueLength":4.3,"venueWidth":5.8,"venueHeight":2.5,"reception":null,"banquet":null,"cabaret":null,"classroom":null,"cocktail":null,"ushape":null,"theatre":null,"boardroom":6,"miceTechnicalEquipment":[{"name":"led TV"},{"name":"high-speed WI-FI"},{"name":"power connection for every attendee"}],"miceServices":[{"name":"cloakroom"},{"name":"storage facilities"},{"name":"av supplier (external)"},{"name":"wheelchair-accessible"},{"name":"air conditioning"},{"name":"coffee and/or tea making facilities"},{"name":"non-smoking"},{"name":"designated room/area for the organiser"},{"name":"sustainable solutions"}],"miceAmbiance":[{"name":"indirect daylight"},{"name":"hybrid boardroom"},{"name":"modern style"}],"galleryImages":[{"name":"Infinite Solutions","title":"Infinite Solutions","description":"Our signature luxury: perfection. The Kempinski Corvinus’ various flexible meeting spaces and services offer state-of-the-art technology, the latest equipment, that deliver tailored solutions for events of any size and purpose.","image":{"image":{"uri":"/var/site/storage/images/0/6/6/6/1566660-1-eng-GB/4fef30e93bd0-75387164_4K.jpg","alternativeText":"","additionalData":{"focalPointX":null,"focalPointY":null},"width":3840,"height":2560}}},{"name":"Attention to details","title":"Attention to details","description":"Anticipating needs and perfect delivery. Every conference is different and requires special attention. The seasoned event team of Kempinski Hotel Corvinus Budapest ensures everything is flawless, from beginning to end. They assist conference organisers in creating experiences that audiences crave and remember.","image":{"image":{"uri":"/var/site/storage/images/0/0/2/7/1567200-1-eng-GB/6ef163d7b6cb-75387102_4K.jpg","alternativeText":"","additionalData":{"focalPointX":null,"focalPointY":null},"width":3840,"height":2560}}}],"_url":"/en/hotel-corvinus-budapest/meetings-events/venues/room-four","button1Title":"Floor Plan","button1InternalLink":{"_url":null,"file":{"uri":"/en/content/download/156076/18520319?version=1"}},"button2Title":"","button2InternalLink":null,"button3Title":"Virtual Tour","button3ExternalLink":"https://speceffect.com/360/kempinski.html"},{"metaTitle":"Room Five Event venue | Kempinski Hotel Corvinus Budapest","metaKeywords":"","metaDescription":"Suitable for up to 10 guests, the Room Five at Kempinski Hotel Corvinus Budapest is the perfect venue for board meetings. Book today.","_location":{"id":144987,"path":[1,2,93563,151000,144984,144987],"pathString":"/1/2/93563/151000/144984/144987/","priority":3,"parentLocation":{"id":144984,"content":{"_name":"Venues"}},"urlAliases":[{"path":"/hotel-corvinus-budapest/meetings-events/venues/room-five","languageCodes":["eng-GB"]},{"path":"/hotel-corvinus-budapest/meetings-events/veranstaltungsorte/room-five","languageCodes":["ger-DE"]},{"path":"/hotel-corvinus-budapest/meetings-events/venues/room-five","languageCodes":["chi-CN"]},{"path":"/hotel-corvinus-budapest/meetings-events-rendezvenyek/helyszinek/room-five","languageCodes":["hun-HU"]}],"customUrlAliases":[]},"_contentInfo":{"id":149251,"currentVersion":{"languageCodes":["eng-GB","ger-DE","chi-CN","hun-HU"]}},"id":"RG9tYWluQ29udGVudDo=","headerImage":{"image":{"uri":"/var/site/storage/images/0/9/9/6/1566990-1-eng-GB/d96135f148e9-75387198_4K.jpg","alternativeText":"","additionalData":{"focalPointX":null,"focalPointY":null},"width":3000,"height":2000}},"title":"Room Five","miceIndoorOutdoor":[{"name":"indoor"},{"name":"dedicated conference/event floor"},{"name":"city centre location"}],"maxRoomOccupancy":10,"venueSize":32,"description":{"html5":"\u003cp\u003eConveniently located on the first floor of Kempinski Hotel Corvinus Budapest, Room Five is a multi-purpose space ideal for meetings and activities that require privacy. The floor is dedicated to events; therefore, Room Five is situated in ideal proximity to the whole portfolio of our T\u003ca href=\"https://admin.kempinski.com/hotel-corvinus-budapest/meetings-events/venues\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cu\u003een Rooms meeting facilities\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/a\u003e. It is accessible via the Lobby\u0026rsquo;s sweeping staircase or the lifts.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eChic, refined and, furthermore, luxurious in size as well as outfitting, Room Five is a deliberately upscale executive room with its own built-in coffee station and a 55-inch Android LCD TV, which can be operated by the wireless, so-called screen mirroring technology from any cordless device. Its d\u0026eacute;cor comes complete with an original painting by Hungarian contemporary artist MSL from the Hotel Corvinus Collection. With over 30 sq m of space, it seats and hosts up to ten guests.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;Its windows open to a view of leafy Erzs\u0026eacute;bet Square, providing an especially quiet corner. Room Five is designed to hold meetings that require privacy, and as such, we recommend it first and foremost for board-level, board-sized discussions in the serenity of Kempinski Hotel Corvinus Budapest's lavish surroundings, next to Room Four.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBesides its boardroom features, Room Five ideally serves as the operating room for larger-scale events to manage and oversee the events in the meeting facilities.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eCatering services, from coffee and Danish pastries to more complex menus such as lunch and dinner, are provided by kitchen teams as required.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eFor inquiries, please contact us on\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href=\"tel://3614293478\"\u003e\u003cu\u003e+36 1 429 3478\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;or at\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href=\"mailto:meetings.corvinus@kempinski.com\"\u003e\u003cu\u003emeetings.corvinus@kempinski.com\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n"},"shortDescription":{"html5":"\u003cp\u003eIdeal for meetings that require privacy. Board level discussions in serenity.\u003c/p\u003e\n"},"rfpButtonText":"Request for Proposal","venueLength":4.3,"venueWidth":8.1,"venueHeight":2.5,"reception":null,"banquet":null,"cabaret":null,"classroom":null,"cocktail":null,"ushape":null,"theatre":null,"boardroom":10,"miceTechnicalEquipment":[{"name":"led TV"},{"name":"high-speed WI-FI"},{"name":"power connection for every attendee"}],"miceServices":[{"name":"av supplier (external)"},{"name":"wheelchair-accessible"},{"name":"air conditioning"},{"name":"coffee and/or tea making facilities"},{"name":"non-smoking"}],"miceAmbiance":[{"name":"natural daylight"},{"name":"sophisticated design elements"},{"name":"modern style"}],"galleryImages":[{"name":"Central location","title":"Central location","description":"Meet and greet. Network. Deals sealed. Entertain. In the very heart of the city, at the Kempinski Corvinus, Budapest means business.","image":{"image":{"uri":"/var/site/storage/images/2/0/2/7/18037202-3-eng-GB/1674add6dcea-95762259_4K.jpg","alternativeText":"Meeting venue  'Room Eleven' exclusive boardroom at Kempinski Hotel Budapest","additionalData":{"focalPointX":null,"focalPointY":null},"width":5760,"height":3840}}},{"name":"Sustainable events","title":"Sustainable Events","description":"By implementing EarthCheck's VenueCheck system, Kempinski Hotel Corvinus proudly extends its sustainability efforts beyond the daily operations to ensure that all events, whether held in the grand room or intimate meeting spaces, reflect the same high standards of environmental responsibility.","image":{"image":{"uri":"/var/site/storage/images/3/8/4/6/16496483-1-eng-GB/d4e7be2c88c8-81179288_4K.jpg","alternativeText":"","additionalData":{"focalPointX":null,"focalPointY":null},"width":3543,"height":2362}}},{"name":"Attention to details","title":"Attention to details","description":"Anticipating needs and perfect delivery. Every conference is different and requires special attention. The seasoned event team of Kempinski Hotel Corvinus Budapest ensures everything is flawless, from beginning to end. They assist conference organisers in creating experiences that audiences crave and remember.","image":{"image":{"uri":"/var/site/storage/images/0/0/2/7/1567200-1-eng-GB/6ef163d7b6cb-75387102_4K.jpg","alternativeText":"","additionalData":{"focalPointX":null,"focalPointY":null},"width":3840,"height":2560}}}],"_url":"/en/hotel-corvinus-budapest/meetings-events/venues/room-five","button1Title":"Floor Plan","button1InternalLink":{"_url":null,"file":{"uri":"/en/content/download/156076/18520319?version=1"}},"button2Title":"","button2InternalLink":null,"button3Title":"Virtual Tour","button3ExternalLink":"https://speceffect.com/360/kempinski.html"},{"metaTitle":"Room Six Meeting Room | Kempinski Hotel Budapest","metaKeywords":"","metaDescription":"Suitable for up to 90 guests, the Room Six at Kempinski Hotel Corvinus Budapest is the perfect venue for any kind of events, conferences. Book today.","_location":{"id":144988,"path":[1,2,93563,151000,144984,144988],"pathString":"/1/2/93563/151000/144984/144988/","priority":4,"parentLocation":{"id":144984,"content":{"_name":"Venues"}},"urlAliases":[{"path":"/hotel-corvinus-budapest/meetings-events/venues/room-six","languageCodes":["eng-GB"]},{"path":"/hotel-corvinus-budapest/meetings-events/veranstaltungsorte/room-six","languageCodes":["ger-DE"]},{"path":"/hotel-corvinus-budapest/meetings-events/venues/room-six","languageCodes":["chi-CN"]},{"path":"/hotel-corvinus-budapest/meetings-events-rendezvenyek/helyszinek/room-six","languageCodes":["hun-HU"]}],"customUrlAliases":[]},"_contentInfo":{"id":149252,"currentVersion":{"languageCodes":["eng-GB","ger-DE","chi-CN","hun-HU"]}},"id":"RG9tYWluQ29udGVudDo=","headerImage":{"image":{"uri":"/var/site/storage/images/0/5/7/6/1566750-1-eng-GB/b3b2bfc024a9-75387172_4K.jpg","alternativeText":"","additionalData":{"focalPointX":null,"focalPointY":null},"width":3840,"height":2560}},"title":"Room Six","miceIndoorOutdoor":[{"name":"indoor"},{"name":"city centre location"},{"name":"dedicated conference/event floor"}],"maxRoomOccupancy":90,"venueSize":130,"description":{"html5":"\u003cp\u003eDesigned to boost creative thinking with its savvy outfitting, Room Six is Ten Rooms\u0026rsquo; wow design space in the very centre of Budapest. It accommodates up to 90 persons and is the perfect choice for smaller conferences as well as cool parties. The floor is covered with parquet flooring instead of carpeting, while the wallpaper is a one-off design specifically to adorn Room Six. Apart from the ambient lighting, the ceiling lights up with several small spotlights to evoke a starlit sky. Bespoke technology completes our smart space. This meeting venue comes with an oversized, 70-inch monitor, which is also capable of wireless image transmission. \u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eReplete with natural light, Room Six benefits from views on two sides of Kempinski Hotel Corvinus, opening the space out to heritage B\u0026eacute;csi utca and leafy Erzs\u0026eacute;bet Park, with its signature Ferris Wheel adding a pulsating beat to the atmosphere.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eRoom Six has sufficient space to offer a mini buffet inside, complementing a theatre-style setup; alternatively, it also benefits from Foyer B right in front of it, capable of accommodating welcome cocktail receptions or coffee breaks. Foyer B features paintings from the hotel\u0026rsquo;s own Corvinus Collection, by G\u0026aacute;bor\u0026nbsp;Kr\u0026uuml;zsely and Bea Krusovszky.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eMulti-functional in its own right, Room Six integrates well with the Infinity Salons. Connected by Foyer B, these spaces form an organic series of locations for different activities and functions of a full-floor event, such as a kids\u0026rsquo; corner or cocktail lounge.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eFor inquiries, please contact us on\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href=\"tel://3614293478\"\u003e\u003cu\u003e+36 1 429 3478\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;or at\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href=\"mailto:meetings.corvinus@kempinski.com\"\u003e\u003cu\u003emeetings.corvinus@kempinski.com\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n"},"shortDescription":{"html5":"\u003cp\u003eDesigned to boost creative thinking in the middle of buzzing Budapest.\u003c/p\u003e\n"},"rfpButtonText":"Request for Proposal","venueLength":12.1,"venueWidth":11.4,"venueHeight":2.5,"reception":90,"banquet":null,"cabaret":42,"classroom":54,"cocktail":null,"ushape":30,"theatre":90,"boardroom":24,"miceTechnicalEquipment":[{"name":"led TV"},{"name":"high-speed WI-FI"},{"name":"superior-quality Bose system audio"}],"miceServices":[{"name":"storage facilities"},{"name":"av supplier (internal)"},{"name":"wheelchair-accessible"},{"name":"air conditioning"},{"name":"coffee and/or tea making facilities"},{"name":"non-smoking"},{"name":"sustainable solutions"}],"miceAmbiance":[{"name":"natural daylight"},{"name":"sophisticated design elements"},{"name":"modern style"}],"galleryImages":[{"name":"Central location","title":"Central location","description":"Meet and greet. Network. Deals sealed. Entertain. In the very heart of the city, at the Kempinski Corvinus, Budapest means business.","image":{"image":{"uri":"/var/site/storage/images/2/0/2/7/18037202-3-eng-GB/1674add6dcea-95762259_4K.jpg","alternativeText":"Meeting venue  'Room Eleven' exclusive boardroom at Kempinski Hotel Budapest","additionalData":{"focalPointX":null,"focalPointY":null},"width":5760,"height":3840}}},{"name":"Amaze your clients","title":"Amaze your clients","description":"Our varied meeting and conference venues bring together people for business and exchange of information. For weddings. Or social fun.","image":{"image":{"uri":"/var/site/storage/images/2/7/6/8/16498672-1-eng-GB/a7bf8c51331e-81181993_4K.jpg","alternativeText":"","additionalData":{"focalPointX":null,"focalPointY":null},"width":3000,"height":1992}}},{"name":"Sustainable events","title":"Sustainable Events","description":"By implementing EarthCheck's VenueCheck system, Kempinski Hotel Corvinus proudly extends its sustainability efforts beyond the daily operations to ensure that all events, whether held in the grand room or intimate meeting spaces, reflect the same high standards of environmental responsibility.","image":{"image":{"uri":"/var/site/storage/images/3/8/4/6/16496483-1-eng-GB/d4e7be2c88c8-81179288_4K.jpg","alternativeText":"","additionalData":{"focalPointX":null,"focalPointY":null},"width":3543,"height":2362}}}],"_url":"/en/hotel-corvinus-budapest/meetings-events/venues/room-six","button1Title":"Floor Plan","button1InternalLink":{"_url":null,"file":{"uri":"/en/content/download/156076/18520319?version=1"}},"button2Title":"","button2InternalLink":null,"button3Title":"Virtual Tour","button3ExternalLink":"https://speceffect.com/360/kempinski.html"},{"metaTitle":"Infinity Room meeting venue | Kempinski Hotel Corvinus Budapest","metaKeywords":"","metaDescription":"Suitable for up to 250 guests, the Infinity Room at Kempinski Hotel Corvinus Budapest is the perfect venue for events, meetings, weddings. Book today.","_location":{"id":150992,"path":[1,2,93563,151000,144984,150992],"pathString":"/1/2/93563/151000/144984/150992/","priority":5,"parentLocation":{"id":144984,"content":{"_name":"Venues"}},"urlAliases":[{"path":"/hotel-corvinus-budapest/meetings-events/venues/infinity-room","languageCodes":["eng-GB"]},{"path":"/hotel-corvinus-budapest/meetings-events/veranstaltungsorte/infinity-room","languageCodes":["ger-DE"]},{"path":"/hotel-corvinus-budapest/meetings-events/venues/infinity-room","languageCodes":["chi-CN"]},{"path":"/hotel-corvinus-budapest/meetings-events-rendezvenyek/helyszinek/infinity-room","languageCodes":["hun-HU"]}],"customUrlAliases":[]},"_contentInfo":{"id":155402,"currentVersion":{"languageCodes":["eng-GB","ger-DE","chi-CN","hun-HU"]}},"id":"RG9tYWluQ29udGVudDo=","headerImage":{"image":{"uri":"/var/site/storage/images/0/3/6/6/1566630-1-eng-GB/648d34e12dd8-75387162_4K.jpg","alternativeText":"","additionalData":{"focalPointX":null,"focalPointY":null},"width":3840,"height":2560}},"title":"Infinity Room","miceIndoorOutdoor":[{"name":"indoor"},{"name":"city centre location"},{"name":"dedicated conference/event floor"}],"maxRoomOccupancy":250,"venueSize":382,"description":{"html5":"\u003cp\u003eInfinity Room (Rooms Seven, Eight, Nine and Ten)\u003cbr\u003eThis capacity-enhanced cluster of reconstructed function rooms now offers maximised space with greater flexibility. Flooded with plenty of natural light, the Infinity Room \u0026ndash; a combination of Rooms Seven, Eight, Nine and Ten \u0026ndash; features a specifically harmonious soft colour palette, with tactile materials and fabrics. The conference labels (logos and signs) appear in magic mirror.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eDo you need flexible space for your event? The Infinity Room offers style, convenience and flexible arrangement solutions in Kempinski Hotel Corvinus Budapest\u0026rsquo;s signature decor and generous space, combined with state-of-the-art technology in over 300 sq m of space, hosting up to 250 guests.\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eOur special tip: use it as a cool event space for an evening get-together with an ice bar and a high DJ counter.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFor planning at a glance: Infinity Room\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eDaylight: Yes\u003cbr\u003eSize: 382.4 sq m (4,116.1 sq ft)\u003cbr\u003eCeiling height: 4 m (13.12 ft)\u003cbr\u003eDimension: 12.1 m (39.68 ft) (length) x 31.8 m (104.30 ft) (width)\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003eMaximum capacity: 250 guests (reception)\u003cbr\u003eSpecial feature: built-in coffee station (on request)\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eDiscreetly separable from the units of Infinity Room, Rooms Seven, Eight, Nine and Ten meeting venues offer daylight and flexible arrangement solutions in the signature decor of Kempinski Hotel Corvinus Budapest and its generously high ceiling, combined with state-of-the-art technology in 95 sq m of space, hosting up to 90 guests per section room.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFor planning at a glance: Room Seven, Room Eight, Room Nine, Room Ten\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eDaylight: Yes\u003cbr\u003eSize: 95.6 sq m (1,028.6 sq ft)\u003cbr\u003eCeiling height: 4 m (13.12 ft)\u003cbr\u003eDimension: 12.1 m (39.68 ft) (length) x 7.8 m (25.58 ft) (width)\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003eMaximum capacity: 90 guests (reception)\u003cbr\u003eSpecial feature: built-in coffee station (on request)\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eDiscreetly separable from the units of Infinity Room, Rooms Seven, Eight, Nine and Ten meeting venues offer daylight and flexible arrangement solutions in the signature decor of Kempinski Hotel Corvinus Budapest and its generously high ceiling, combined with state-of-the-art technology in 95 sq m of space, hosting up to 90 guests per section room.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eFor inquiries, please contact us on\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href=\"tel://3614293478\"\u003e\u003cu\u003e+36 1 429 3478\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;or at\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href=\"mailto:meetings.corvinus@kempinski.com\"\u003e\u003cu\u003emeetings.corvinus@kempinski.com\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n"},"shortDescription":{"html5":"\u003cp\u003eCombination of Room Seven, Room Eight, Room Nine, Room Ten\u003c/p\u003e\n"},"rfpButtonText":"Request for Proposal","venueLength":12.1,"venueWidth":31.8,"venueHeight":4,"reception":250,"banquet":240,"cabaret":105,"classroom":110,"cocktail":null,"ushape":null,"theatre":250,"boardroom":null,"miceTechnicalEquipment":[{"name":"versatile lighting palette (RGB scale)"},{"name":"superior-quality Bose system audio"}],"miceServices":[{"name":"cloakroom"},{"name":"storage facilities"},{"name":"av supplier (external)"},{"name":"wheelchair-accessible"},{"name":"air conditioning"},{"name":"coffee and/or tea making facilities"},{"name":"non-smoking"},{"name":"seperable meeting/event rooms"},{"name":"connecting meeting/event rooms"},{"name":"sustainable solutions"}],"miceAmbiance":[{"name":"natural daylight"},{"name":"customised lighting for company/event colours"},{"name":"modern style"}],"galleryImages":[{"name":"Infinite Solutions","title":"Infinite Solutions","description":"Our signature luxury: perfection. The Kempinski Corvinus’ various flexible meeting spaces and services offer state-of-the-art technology, the latest equipment, that deliver tailored solutions for events of any size and purpose.","image":{"image":{"uri":"/var/site/storage/images/0/6/6/6/1566660-1-eng-GB/4fef30e93bd0-75387164_4K.jpg","alternativeText":"","additionalData":{"focalPointX":null,"focalPointY":null},"width":3840,"height":2560}}},{"name":"Infinity Room","title":"Infinity Room","description":"","image":{"image":{"uri":"/var/site/storage/images/0/2/7/6/1566720-1-eng-GB/4b08b0acd7e5-75387170_4K.jpg","alternativeText":"","additionalData":{"focalPointX":null,"focalPointY":null},"width":3840,"height":2560}}},{"name":"Room Seven","title":"Room Seven","description":"","image":{"image":{"uri":"/var/site/storage/images/0/2/0/7/1567020-1-eng-GB/2cb585648d92-75387190_4K.jpg","alternativeText":"","additionalData":{"focalPointX":null,"focalPointY":null},"width":3840,"height":2560}}},{"name":"Room Eight","title":"Room Eight","description":"","image":{"image":{"uri":"/var/site/storage/images/0/6/6/6/1566660-1-eng-GB/4fef30e93bd0-75387164_4K.jpg","alternativeText":"","additionalData":{"focalPointX":null,"focalPointY":null},"width":3840,"height":2560}}},{"name":"Room Nine","title":"Room Nine","description":"","image":{"image":{"uri":"/var/site/storage/images/0/6/9/6/1566960-1-eng-GB/2e0735e681ef-75387196_4K.jpg","alternativeText":"","additionalData":{"focalPointX":null,"focalPointY":null},"width":3840,"height":2560}}},{"name":"Room Ten","title":"Room Ten","description":"","image":{"image":{"uri":"/var/site/storage/images/0/5/0/7/1567050-1-eng-GB/ebd0c70b8ce3-75387192_4K.jpg","alternativeText":"","additionalData":{"focalPointX":null,"focalPointY":null},"width":3840,"height":2560}}},{"name":"Sustainable events","title":"Sustainable Events","description":"By implementing EarthCheck's VenueCheck system, Kempinski Hotel Corvinus proudly extends its sustainability efforts beyond the daily operations to ensure that all events, whether held in the grand room or intimate meeting spaces, reflect the same high standards of environmental responsibility.","image":{"image":{"uri":"/var/site/storage/images/3/8/4/6/16496483-1-eng-GB/d4e7be2c88c8-81179288_4K.jpg","alternativeText":"","additionalData":{"focalPointX":null,"focalPointY":null},"width":3543,"height":2362}}}],"_url":"/en/hotel-corvinus-budapest/meetings-events/venues/infinity-room","button1Title":"Floor Plan","button1InternalLink":{"_url":null,"file":{"uri":"/en/content/download/156076/18520319?version=1"}},"button2Title":"","button2InternalLink":null,"button3Title":"Virtual Tour","button3ExternalLink":"https://speceffect.com/360/kempinski.html"},{"metaTitle":"FOYERS A+B | Kempinski Hotel Corvinus Budapest","metaKeywords":"","metaDescription":"Suitable for up to 300 guests, the Foyers at Kempinski Hotel Corvinus Budapest is the perfect venue for exhibitions, coffee breaks. Book today.","_location":{"id":150995,"path":[1,2,93563,151000,144984,150995],"pathString":"/1/2/93563/151000/144984/150995/","priority":7,"parentLocation":{"id":144984,"content":{"_name":"Venues"}},"urlAliases":[{"path":"/hotel-corvinus-budapest/meetings-events/venues/foyers","languageCodes":["eng-GB"]},{"path":"/hotel-corvinus-budapest/meetings-events/veranstaltungsorte/foyers","languageCodes":["ger-DE"]},{"path":"/hotel-corvinus-budapest/meetings-events/venues/foyers","languageCodes":["chi-CN"]},{"path":"/hotel-corvinus-budapest/meetings-events-rendezvenyek/helyszinek/foyers","languageCodes":["hun-HU"]}],"customUrlAliases":[]},"_contentInfo":{"id":155406,"currentVersion":{"languageCodes":["eng-GB","ger-DE","chi-CN","hun-HU"]}},"id":"RG9tYWluQ29udGVudDo=","headerImage":{"image":{"uri":"/var/site/storage/images/0/0/9/6/1566900-1-eng-GB/990ec49f3e06-75387182_4K.jpg","alternativeText":"","additionalData":{"focalPointX":null,"focalPointY":null},"width":3840,"height":2560}},"title":"Foyers","miceIndoorOutdoor":[{"name":"indoor"},{"name":"city centre location"},{"name":"dedicated conference/event floor"}],"maxRoomOccupancy":300,"venueSize":245,"description":{"html5":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFoyer A\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eReceptions in style: impress your delegates at Kempinski Hotel Corvinus Budapest. Foyer A offers unique hosting solutions, for up to 300 guests. Due to its height, the space is ideal as an exhibition area, benefitting from the natural light that the glass rooftop affords. Foyer A comes with a built-in barista station, seating area and The Kitchen.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eFor planning at a glance: Foyer A\u003cbr\u003eDaylight: from the lobby\u003cbr\u003eSize: 245 sq m (2,636.2 sq ft)\u003cbr\u003eCeiling height: 5.32 m (17.45 ft)\u003cbr\u003eMaximum capacity: 300 guests (reception)\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFoyer B\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eA contemporary space, Foyer B facilitates the hosting of social functions as well as business gatherings in a comfortable environment. Its remarkable versatility allows for diverse purposes such as coffee breaks, catering, brainstorming and reception. It offers two built-in hospitality desks, with a projection screen in the background, for the registration of delegates and information points during the events.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eFor planning at a glance: Foyer B\u003cbr\u003eDaylight: from the lobby\u003cbr\u003eSize: 150 sq m (1,615 sq ft)\u003cbr\u003eCeiling height (lowest): 2.5 m (8.2 ft)\u003cbr\u003eMaximum capacity: 100 guests (reception)\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eFor inquiries, please contact us on\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href=\"tel://3614293478\"\u003e\u003cu\u003e+36 1 429 3478\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;or at\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href=\"mailto:meetings.corvinus@kempinski.com\"\u003e\u003cu\u003emeetings.corvinus@kempinski.com\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/a\u003e.\u003cbr\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n"},"shortDescription":{"html5":"\u003cp\u003eContemporary space for coffee breaks, catering and brainstorming.\u003c/p\u003e\n"},"rfpButtonText":"Request for Proposal","venueLength":30,"venueWidth":3,"venueHeight":5.3,"reception":300,"banquet":null,"cabaret":null,"classroom":null,"cocktail":null,"ushape":null,"theatre":null,"boardroom":null,"miceTechnicalEquipment":[{"name":"high-speed WI-FI"},{"name":"superior-quality Bose system audio"}],"miceServices":[{"name":"cloakroom"},{"name":"storage facilities"},{"name":"av supplier (external)"},{"name":"wheelchair-accessible"},{"name":"air conditioning"},{"name":"non-smoking"},{"name":"coffee and/or tea making facilities"},{"name":"pop-up kitchen on foyer area"},{"name":"sustainable solutions"}],"miceAmbiance":[{"name":"natural daylight"},{"name":"glass roof"},{"name":"modern style"}],"galleryImages":[{"name":"Amaze your clients","title":"Amaze your clients","description":"Our varied meeting and conference venues bring together people for business and exchange of information. For weddings. Or social fun.","image":{"image":{"uri":"/var/site/storage/images/2/7/6/8/16498672-1-eng-GB/a7bf8c51331e-81181993_4K.jpg","alternativeText":"","additionalData":{"focalPointX":null,"focalPointY":null},"width":3000,"height":1992}}},{"name":"Foyer A","title":"Foyer A","description":"","image":{"image":{"uri":"/var/site/storage/images/0/6/2/7/1567260-1-eng-GB/49a76b9e54f9-75387116_4K.jpg","alternativeText":"","additionalData":{"focalPointX":null,"focalPointY":null},"width":3000,"height":2000}}},{"name":"Foyer B","title":"Foyer B","description":"","image":{"image":{"uri":"/var/site/storage/images/0/0/9/6/1566900-1-eng-GB/990ec49f3e06-75387182_4K.jpg","alternativeText":"","additionalData":{"focalPointX":null,"focalPointY":null},"width":3840,"height":2560}}},{"name":"Attention to details","title":"Attention to details","description":"Anticipating needs and perfect delivery. Every conference is different and requires special attention. The seasoned event team of Kempinski Hotel Corvinus Budapest ensures everything is flawless, from beginning to end. They assist conference organisers in creating experiences that audiences crave and remember.","image":{"image":{"uri":"/var/site/storage/images/0/0/2/7/1567200-1-eng-GB/6ef163d7b6cb-75387102_4K.jpg","alternativeText":"","additionalData":{"focalPointX":null,"focalPointY":null},"width":3840,"height":2560}}}],"_url":"/en/hotel-corvinus-budapest/meetings-events/venues/foyers","button1Title":"Floor Plan","button1InternalLink":{"_url":null,"file":{"uri":"/en/content/download/156076/18520319?version=1"}},"button2Title":"","button2InternalLink":null,"button3Title":"Virtual Tour","button3ExternalLink":"https://speceffect.com/360/kempinski.html"},{"metaTitle":"Room Eleven Meeting Room | Kempinski Hotel Corvinus Budapest","metaKeywords":"","metaDescription":"Suitable for up to 8 guests, the Room Eleven at Kempinski Hotel Corvinus Budapest is the perfect venue for private discussions. Book today.","_location":{"id":151110,"path":[1,2,93563,151000,144984,151110],"pathString":"/1/2/93563/151000/144984/151110/","priority":6,"parentLocation":{"id":144984,"content":{"_name":"Venues"}},"urlAliases":[{"path":"/hotel-corvinus-budapest/meetings-events/venues/room-eleven","languageCodes":["eng-GB"]},{"path":"/hotel-corvinus-budapest/meetings-events/veranstaltungsorte/room-eleven","languageCodes":["ger-DE"]},{"path":"/hotel-corvinus-budapest/meetings-events/venues/room-eleven","languageCodes":["chi-CN"]},{"path":"/hotel-corvinus-budapest/meetings-events-rendezvenyek/helyszinek/room-eleven","languageCodes":["hun-HU"]}],"customUrlAliases":[]},"_contentInfo":{"id":155544,"currentVersion":{"languageCodes":["eng-GB","ger-DE","chi-CN","hun-HU"]}},"id":"RG9tYWluQ29udGVudDo=","headerImage":{"image":{"uri":"/var/site/storage/images/2/0/2/7/18037202-3-eng-GB/1674add6dcea-95762259_4K.jpg","alternativeText":"Meeting venue  'Room Eleven' exclusive boardroom at Kempinski Hotel Budapest","additionalData":{"focalPointX":null,"focalPointY":null},"width":5760,"height":3840}},"title":"Room Eleven","miceIndoorOutdoor":[{"name":"indoor"}],"maxRoomOccupancy":8,"venueSize":25,"description":{"html5":"\u003cp\u003eThe newly redesigned Business Centre offers a sophisticated and inspiring space for all the guests\u0026rsquo; professional needs. Now featuring an additional boardroom, it provides the perfect setting for meetings, brainstorming sessions and private discussions. Designed with modern amenities and a sleek, contemporary aesthetic, the space ensures comfort and efficiency for business travellers and corporate guests alike.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eConveniently located on the event floor, the Business Centre is easily accessible for conferences, workshops and networking events. Equipped with state-of-the-art technology, high-speed internet and premium furnishings, it fosters productivity and seamless collaboration. Whether guests need a quiet space to work, a professional setting for client meetings or an additional boardroom for strategic discussions, our enhanced facilities are tailored to meet their business requirements.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eExperience a new level of convenience and professionalism at the revitalised Business Centre, where innovation meets elegance in the heart of the hotel.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eFor inquiries, please contact us on\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href=\"tel://3614293478\"\u003e\u003cu\u003e+36 1 429 3478\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;or at\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href=\"mailto:meetings.corvinus@kempinski.com\"\u003e\u003cu\u003emeetings.corvinus@kempinski.com\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n"},"shortDescription":{"html5":"\u003cp\u003eBoard Room at the Business Centre \u0026ndash; Modern \u0026amp; Inspiring.\u003c/p\u003e\n"},"rfpButtonText":"Request for Proposal","venueLength":9.6,"venueWidth":3.2,"venueHeight":2.5,"reception":null,"banquet":null,"cabaret":null,"classroom":null,"cocktail":null,"ushape":null,"theatre":null,"boardroom":8,"miceTechnicalEquipment":[{"name":"videoconferencing"},{"name":"led TV"},{"name":"high-speed WI-FI"},{"name":"power connection for every attendee"}],"miceServices":[{"name":"av supplier (external)"},{"name":"wheelchair-accessible"},{"name":"air conditioning"},{"name":"coffee and/or tea making facilities"},{"name":"non-smoking"},{"name":"business center"},{"name":"sustainable solutions"}],"miceAmbiance":[{"name":"indirect daylight"},{"name":"hybrid boardroom"},{"name":"modern style"}],"galleryImages":[{"name":"Central location","title":"Central location","description":"Meet and greet. Network. Deals sealed. Entertain. In the very heart of the city, at the Kempinski Corvinus, Budapest means business.","image":{"image":{"uri":"/var/site/storage/images/2/0/2/7/18037202-3-eng-GB/1674add6dcea-95762259_4K.jpg","alternativeText":"Meeting venue  'Room Eleven' exclusive boardroom at Kempinski Hotel Budapest","additionalData":{"focalPointX":null,"focalPointY":null},"width":5760,"height":3840}}},{"name":"Amaze your clients","title":"Amaze your clients","description":"Our varied meeting and conference venues bring together people for business and exchange of information. For weddings. Or social fun.","image":{"image":{"uri":"/var/site/storage/images/2/7/6/8/16498672-1-eng-GB/a7bf8c51331e-81181993_4K.jpg","alternativeText":"","additionalData":{"focalPointX":null,"focalPointY":null},"width":3000,"height":1992}}}],"_url":"/en/hotel-corvinus-budapest/meetings-events/venues/room-eleven","button1Title":"Floor Plan","button1InternalLink":{"_url":null,"file":{"uri":"/en/content/download/156076/18520319?version=1"}},"button2Title":"","button2InternalLink":null,"button3Title":"","button3ExternalLink":""}],"miceConfigs":[{"name":"Reception","capacityIdentifier":"Capacity for Reception Setting","icon":{"uri":"/en/content/download/137905/17834017?version=22"}},{"name":"Classroom","capacityIdentifier":"Capacity for Classroom Setting","icon":{"uri":"/en/content/download/137902/17833778?version=21"}},{"name":"Boardroom","capacityIdentifier":"Capacity for Boardroom Setting","icon":{"uri":"/en/content/download/108721/16674847?version=21"}}],"capacityChartTitle":"Our Venues – Infinite Solutions","button1Title":"F